      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153\n\nSerious drug offences  Schedule 1\n\nNo. 153, 2015\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015\n\n(e) that a substance is a border controlled precursor (a physical\nelement of an offence against Subdivision D of Division 307\nor section 309.14 or 309.15).\nNote:\nProof of intention, knowledge or recklessness will satisfy a fault\nelement of recklessness: see subsection 5.4(4).",
      "skos:definition": "ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153\n\nSerious drug offences  Schedule 1\n\nNo. 153, 2015\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015\n\n(e) that a substance is a border controlled precursor (a physical\nelement of an offence against Subdivision D of Division 307\nor section 309.14 or 309.15).\nNote:\nProof of intention, knowledge or recklessness will satisfy a fault\nelement of recklessness: see subsection 5.4(4).",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-1-sec-309-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-1-sec-309-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3e075c7bc686939d205d4c1ed2669d9bfa94572f9ad420d8b59ea6beb5ca0033",
      "skos:note": "Proof of intention, knowledge or recklessness satisfies a fault element of recklessness."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-1-sec-309-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "309 13);",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 10,
      "values:originalText": "ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153\n\nSerious drug offences  Schedule 1\n\nNo. 153, 2015\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015\n\n(e) that a substance is a border controlled precursor (a physical\nelement of an offence against Subdivision D of Division 307\nor section 309.14 or 309.15).\nNote:\nProof of intention, knowledge or recklessness will satisfy a fault\nelement of recklessness: see subsection 5.4(4)."
    },
