      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf, p.16",
      "values:originalText": "The amendment made by this Part applies in relation to determining, on\nor after the commencement of this item, a sentence to be passed, or an\norder to be made, in respect of a person, whether the person is convicted\nbefore, at or after that commencement.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153\n\nSentencing and parole  Schedule 7\nCooperation with law enforcement agencies  Part 2\n\nNo. 153, 2015\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015",
      "skos:definition": "The amendment made by this Part applies in relation to determining, on\nor after the commencement of this item, a sentence to be passed, or an\norder to be made, in respect of a person, whether the person is convicted\nbefore, at or after that commencement.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153\n\nSentencing and parole  Schedule 7\nCooperation with law enforcement agencies  Part 2\n\nNo. 153, 2015\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015",
      "cml:asserts": [
