      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "The amendment made by this Part applies in relation to a federal\nsentence imposed on or after the commencement of this item.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153\n\nSentencing and parole  Schedule 7\nNon-parole periods and recognizance release orders  Part 4\n\nNo. 153, 2015\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015",
      "skos:definition": "The amendment made by this Part applies in relation to a federal\nsentence imposed on or after the commencement of this item.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153\n\nSentencing and parole  Schedule 7\nNon-parole periods and recognizance release orders  Part 4\n\nNo. 153, 2015\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015",
