      "skos:note": "Amendment applies in relation to federal sentences imposed on or after commencement of this item."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-7-sec-9",
