      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf, p.24",
      "values:originalText": "(6) An amendment of a sentencing order under this section does not\naffect any right of appeal against a sentence.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153\n\nSentencing and parole  Schedule 7\nRectification of errors in sentences, non-parole periods and recognizance release orders",
      "skos:definition": "(6) An amendment of a sentencing order under this section does not\naffect any right of appeal against a sentence.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153\n\nSentencing and parole  Schedule 7\nRectification of errors in sentences, non-parole periods and recognizance release orders",
