      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf, p.25",
      "values:originalText": "The amendment made by this Part applies to a sentencing order made\nbefore, on or after the commencement of this item.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153\n\nSchedule 7  Sentencing and parole",
      "skos:definition": "The amendment made by this Part applies to a sentencing order made\nbefore, on or after the commencement of this item.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153\n\nSchedule 7  Sentencing and parole",
      "cml:asserts": [
