      "values:originalText": "Add:\nNote 1:\nFor when a person is released on parole in accordance with a parole\norder, see section 19AM.\nNote 2:\nA person released on parole must comply with any conditions of the\nparole order during the parole period (see sections 19AMA, 19AN and\n19AU).",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\nNote 1:\nFor when a person is released on parole in accordance with a parole\norder, see section 19AM.\nNote 2:\nA person released on parole must comply with any conditions of the\nparole order during the parole period (see sections 19AMA, 19AN and\n19AU).",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-7-sec-28-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-7-sec-28-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d157cf26fdc1f9186489fec614eb43d7043af5be10c59c1c89e69e66406fd374",
      "skos:note": "Compliance with parole conditions is mandatory."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-7-sec-28",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "28 At the end of subsection 19AL(3)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 29,
      "values:originalText": "Add:\nNote 1:\nFor when a person is released on parole in accordance with a parole\norder, see section 19AM.\nNote 2:\nA person released on parole must comply with any conditions of the\nparole order during the parole period (see sections 19AMA, 19AN and\n19AU)."
    },
