    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-7-sec-29",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "29 Subsection 19AL(4)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-7-sec-29"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf, p.29",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\nPerson subject to State or Territory sentence\n\n(4) Subsections (5) and (6) apply if the person is subject to a State or\nTerritory sentence.\n\n(5) The Attorney-General is not required to make, or to refuse to\nmake, a parole order under subsection (1) or paragraph (2)(b) if:\n\n(a) the State or Territory sentence is a life sentence for which a\nnon-parole period has not been fixed; or\n\n(b) the State or Territory sentence ends after the end of the last of\nthe federal sentences to end; or\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153\n\nSchedule 7  Sentencing and parole",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\nPerson subject to State or Territory sentence\n\n(4) Subsections (5) and (6) apply if the person is subject to a State or\nTerritory sentence.\n\n(5) The Attorney-General is not required to make, or to refuse to\nmake, a parole order under subsection (1) or paragraph (2)(b) if:\n\n(a) the State or Territory sentence is a life sentence for which a\nnon-parole period has not been fixed; or\n\n(b) the State or Territory sentence ends after the end of the last of\nthe federal sentences to end; or\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153\n\nSchedule 7  Sentencing and parole",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-7-sec-29-ss-4"
        },
