      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "01719b1eb4b78317e28830baba519a58c0ffb28752349f4e39562a769ed59309",
      "skos:note": "Savings provision for parole orders and decisions made under section 19AL of the Crimes Act 1914."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-7-sec-31",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "31 Savings provision",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 30,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nA parole order:\n\n(a) made under section 19AL of the Crimes Act 1914; and\n\n(b) in force just before the commencement of this item;\nhas effect, from that commencement, as if it had been made under that\nsection as amended by this Part.\n(2)\nA decision:\n\n(a) made by the Attorney-General under section 19AL of the\nCrimes Act 1914 before the commencement of this item; and\n\n(b)  not revoked before that commencement;\nhas effect, from that commencement, as if it had been made under that\nsection as amended by this Part.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153\n\nSentencing and parole  Schedule 7\nEarly release on parole  Part 8\n\nNo. 153, 2015\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-7-sec-31-norm",
