      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf, p.36",
      "values:originalText": "The amendments made by this Part apply in relation to determining, on\nor after the commencement of this item, a sentence to be passed, or an\norder to be made, in respect of a person, whether the person is convicted\nbefore, at or after that commencement.",
      "skos:definition": "The amendments made by this Part apply in relation to determining, on\nor after the commencement of this item, a sentence to be passed, or an\norder to be made, in respect of a person, whether the person is convicted\nbefore, at or after that commencement.",
      "cml:asserts": [
