    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-8-sec-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3 After subsection 17(3)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-8-sec-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf, p.37",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(3A) Without limiting subsection (1) or (3), it is sufficient compliance\nwith a transfer order if the prisoner or remand prisoner:\n\n(a) is delivered into the custody of an escort of the State or\nTerritory to which the prisoner is being transferred, being an\nescort who is authorised by the local prisons authority for\nthat State or Territory to receive custody of the prisoner; and\n\n(b) is so delivered into custody at a place at which the escort\nmentioned in paragraph (a) is authorised by the local prisons\nauthority for that State or Territory to receive custody of the\nprisoner.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(3A) Without limiting subsection (1) or (3), it is sufficient compliance\nwith a transfer order if the prisoner or remand prisoner:\n\n(a) is delivered into the custody of an escort of the State or\nTerritory to which the prisoner is being transferred, being an\nescort who is authorised by the local prisons authority for\nthat State or Territory to receive custody of the prisoner; and\n\n(b) is so delivered into custody at a place at which the escort\nmentioned in paragraph (a) is authorised by the local prisons\nauthority for that State or Territory to receive custody of the\nprisoner.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-8-sec-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-8-sec-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d43420048c3de066c981ac23d53e7bfe9815b707d1139ccc5bfc503c1797cdde",
      "skos:note": "Compliance with transfer order sufficient if delivered into custody of authorized escort."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-8-sec-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3 After subsection 17(3)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 37,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(3A) Without limiting subsection (1) or (3), it is sufficient compliance\nwith a transfer order if the prisoner or remand prisoner:\n\n(a) is delivered into the custody of an escort of the State or\nTerritory to which the prisoner is being transferred, being an\nescort who is authorised by the local prisons authority for\nthat State or Territory to receive custody of the prisoner; and\n\n(b) is so delivered into custody at a place at which the escort\nmentioned in paragraph (a) is authorised by the local prisons\nauthority for that State or Territory to receive custody of the\nprisoner."
    },
