      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf, p.38",
      "values:originalText": "(6) Despite subsection (4), the Registrar or another officer of a court is\nnot required to comply with a notice given under subsection (3) to\nthe extent that the information relates to proceedings that have not\nbeen finally determined by the court.\n20BZB  Authorised officers may disclose federal offender\ninformation",
      "skos:definition": "(6) Despite subsection (4), the Registrar or another officer of a court is\nnot required to comply with a notice given under subsection (3) to\nthe extent that the information relates to proceedings that have not\nbeen finally determined by the court.\n20BZB  Authorised officers may disclose federal offender\ninformation",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-9-sec-20bz"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
