      "values:originalText": "(9) The Integrity Commissioner must advise the head of the law\nenforcement agency of a decision under subsection (2) to take no\nfurther action in relation to the corruption issue. That advice must\nbe given:\n\n(a) in writing; and\n\n(b) as soon as reasonably practicable after the decision is made.",
      "skos:definition": "(9) The Integrity Commissioner must advise the head of the law\nenforcement agency of a decision under subsection (2) to take no\nfurther action in relation to the corruption issue. That advice must\nbe given:\n\n(a) in writing; and\n\n(b) as soon as reasonably practicable after the decision is made.",
