    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-11-sec-27",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "27 Application of amendments",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-11-sec-27"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf, p.51",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nSubsection 17(2) of the Law Enforcement Integrity Commissioner Act\n2006 (as inserted by this Schedule) applies to agreements made on or\nafter the day that subsection commences.\n(2)\nSubsection 17(3) of the Law Enforcement Integrity Commissioner Act\n2006 (as inserted by this Schedule) applies to agreements made before,\non or after the day that subsection commences.\n(3)\nThe amendments made by items 7, 13, 17, 18, 19, 20 and 21 apply in\nrelation to referrals under section 23 of the Law Enforcement Integrity\nCommissioner Act 2006 given on or after the day those items\ncommence.\n(4)\nThe amendments made by items 8 and 9 apply in relation to\nnotifications, or referrals, referred to in subsection 31(1) of the Law\nEnforcement Integrity Commissioner Act 2006 that are given on or after\nthe day those items commence.\n(5)\nThe amendments made by items 10 to 12 apply in relation to\nnotifications referred to in subsection 32(1) of the Law Enforcement\nIntegrity Commissioner Act 2006 that are given on or after the day those\nitems commence.\n(6)\nThe amendment made by item 24 applies in relation to persons engaged\nbefore, on or after the day that item commences.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153\n\nSchedule 11  Australian Commission for Law Enforcement Integrity\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015\nNo. 153, 2015\n\n(7)\nThe amendment made by item 25 applies to disclosures of information\non or after the day that item commences (whenever the information was\nobtained).\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153\n\nAustralian Crime Commission  Schedule 12\n\nNo. 153, 2015\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nSubsection 17(2) of the Law Enforcement Integrity Commissioner Act\n2006 (as inserted by this Schedule) applies to agreements made on or\nafter the day that subsection commences.\n(2)\nSubsection 17(3) of the Law Enforcement Integrity Commissioner Act\n2006 (as inserted by this Schedule) applies to agreements made before,\non or after the day that subsection commences.\n(3)\nThe amendments made by items 7, 13, 17, 18, 19, 20 and 21 apply in\nrelation to referrals under section 23 of the Law Enforcement Integrity\nCommissioner Act 2006 given on or after the day those items\ncommence.\n(4)\nThe amendments made by items 8 and 9 apply in relation to\nnotifications, or referrals, referred to in subsection 31(1) of the Law\nEnforcement Integrity Commissioner Act 2006 that are given on or after\nthe day those items commence.\n(5)\nThe amendments made by items 10 to 12 apply in relation to\nnotifications referred to in subsection 32(1) of the Law Enforcement\nIntegrity Commissioner Act 2006 that are given on or after the day those\nitems commence.\n(6)\nThe amendment made by item 24 applies in relation to persons engaged\nbefore, on or after the day that item commences.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153\n\nSchedule 11  Australian Commission for Law Enforcement Integrity\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015\nNo. 153, 2015\n\n(7)\nThe amendment made by item 25 applies to disclosures of information\non or after the day that item commences (whenever the information was\nobtained).\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153\n\nAustralian Crime Commission  Schedule 12\n\nNo. 153, 2015\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-11-sec-27-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-11-sec-27-logic-alleninterval-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "847ca71d71febf88f27ee16daea197ec6735ce06df6e7f6435ae40a3ca7c24fa",
      "skos:note": "Conditional commencement and applicability of amendments"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-11-sec-27",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "27 Application of amendments",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 51,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nSubsection 17(2) of the Law Enforcement Integrity Commissioner Act\n2006 (as inserted by this Schedule) applies to agreements made on or\nafter the day that subsection commences.\n(2)\nSubsection 17(3) of the Law Enforcement Integrity Commissioner Act\n2006 (as inserted by this Schedule) applies to agreements made before,\non or after the day that subsection commences.\n(3)\nThe amendments made by items 7, 13, 17, 18, 19, 20 and 21 apply in\nrelation to referrals under section 23 of the Law Enforcement Integrity\nCommissioner Act 2006 given on or after the day those items\ncommence.\n(4)\nThe amendments made by items 8 and 9 apply in relation to\nnotifications, or referrals, referred to in subsection 31(1) of the Law\nEnforcement Integrity Commissioner Act 2006 that are given on or after\nthe day those items commence.\n(5)\nThe amendments made by items 10 to 12 apply in relation to\nnotifications referred to in subsection 32(1) of the Law Enforcement\nIntegrity Commissioner Act 2006 that are given on or after the day those\nitems commence.\n(6)\nThe amendment made by item 24 applies in relation to persons engaged\nbefore, on or after the day that item commences.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153\n\nSchedule 11  Australian Commission for Law Enforcement Integrity\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015\nNo. 153, 2015\n\n(7)\nThe amendment made by item 25 applies to disclosures of information\non or after the day that item commences (whenever the information was\nobtained).\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153\n\nAustralian Crime Commission  Schedule 12\n\nNo. 153, 2015\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015"
    },
