      "values:originalText": "The amendment made by item 6 applies in relation to items produced\nbefore, at or after the commencement of that item.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153\n\nSchedule 13  Proceeds of crime—penalties\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015\nNo. 153, 2015",
