      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf, p.59",
      "values:originalText": "Section 42 of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979, as amended by\nthis Division, applies in relation to a restraining order applied for on or\nafter the commencement of this Division, whether the physical elements\nof either or both of the offences concerned occurred before, on or after\nthat commencement.\nCrimes (Superannuation Benefits) Act 1989",
      "skos:definition": "Section 42 of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979, as amended by\nthis Division, applies in relation to a restraining order applied for on or\nafter the commencement of this Division, whether the physical elements\nof either or both of the offences concerned occurred before, on or after\nthat commencement.\nCrimes (Superannuation Benefits) Act 1989",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-14-sec-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-14-sec-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
