    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-14-sec-315c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "315C Official Trustee may bring proceedings on behalf of the",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-14-sec-315c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf, p.62",
      "values:originalText": "Commonwealth\n\nThe *Official Trustee may bring proceedings on behalf of the\nCommonwealth if, in the Official Trustee’s opinion, doing so will\nfacilitate the performance of a function or duty, or the exercise of a\npower, of the Official Trustee under this Act.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153\n\nState law enforcement agencies  Schedule 15\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 153, 2015\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015",
      "skos:definition": "Commonwealth\n\nThe *Official Trustee may bring proceedings on behalf of the\nCommonwealth if, in the Official Trustee’s opinion, doing so will\nfacilitate the performance of a function or duty, or the exercise of a\npower, of the Official Trustee under this Act.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153\n\nState law enforcement agencies  Schedule 15\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 153, 2015\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-14-sec-315c-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-14-sec-315c-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "777bf0dec71ba40cbf21bb4c6d1eb85296d814b14d0be29f1c68b25519068b7c",
      "skos:note": "Official Trustee may bring proceedings on behalf of the Commonwealth."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-14-sec-315c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "315C Official Trustee may bring proceedings on behalf of the",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 62,
      "values:originalText": "Commonwealth\n\nThe *Official Trustee may bring proceedings on behalf of the\nCommonwealth if, in the Official Trustee’s opinion, doing so will\nfacilitate the performance of a function or duty, or the exercise of a\npower, of the Official Trustee under this Act.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153\n\nState law enforcement agencies  Schedule 15\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 153, 2015\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015"
    },
